ctual dimensions, wrapping, container structure or mode-attribute locations are needed. Use the live observation instead of tracing framework/npm implementations to guess rendered DOM.\",\"coverage\":\"Fresh rectangles, bounded semantic-region structure, attribute locations and computed layout styles. No text, input values, arbitrary selectors or JavaScript.\",\"evidenceBoundary\":\"Tool availability is not proof that the preview is connected or the goal is satisfied. Explicit geometry outcomes need fresh relevant rectangles before completion; a static pass alone is insufficient. Enable a tool group alone before using its tools.\"},\"projection\":{\"kind\":\"navigation_summary\",\"omitted\":[\"repeated Plugin authoring descriptions/intents\",\"action labels/descriptions\",\"duplicate capability instance placement\"],\"fullResult\":{\"tool\":\"inspect_ui_project\",\"input\":{\"view\":\"composition\",\"detail\":\"full\"}},\"pluginDetails\":\"inspect_ui_plugin returns the selected Plugin's full API, composition and ownership\"}}}","role":"tool"}

